{"id":"65e907437b325bca","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-strategy-premouse.md","title":"ZFC Strategy Premouse","display":"df-zfc-strategy-premouse — ZFC Strategy Premouse","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-strategy-premouse","aliases":["58-df-zfc-strategy-premouse"],"display":"df-zfc-strategy-premouse — ZFC Strategy Premouse","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-strategy-premouse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-strategy-premouse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-strategy-premouse — ZFC Strategy Premouse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1048d44b28527ff2\" href=\"?note=1048d44b28527ff2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0134626c9734e3cd\" href=\"?note=0134626c9734e3cd\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Sigma,\\theta\">\\(M,\\Sigma,\\theta\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S\\)</span> (premouse predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1048d44b28527ff2\" href=\"?note=1048d44b28527ff2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}\">\\(\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}\\)</span> (iteration-strategy predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0134626c9734e3cd\" href=\"?note=0134626c9734e3cd\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrategyPremouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StrategyPremouse}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{StrategyPremouse}_S(M,\\Sigma,\\theta) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(M)\\land \\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{StrategyPremouse}_S(M,\\Sigma,\\theta) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(M)\\land \\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A strategy premouse is the premouse together with its specified <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>-bounded iteration strategy; the well-founded branch requirement is already part of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)\">\\(\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>No independent “every iteration tree is well-founded” conjunct is imposed: at limit length, iterability is witnessed by the branch selected by the strategy.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"1048d44b28527ff2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md","status":"resolved","id":"0134626c9734e3cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md","status":"resolved","id":"1048d44b28527ff2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S$ (premouse predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-model7-premouse.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md","status":"resolved","id":"0134626c9734e3cd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}$ (iteration-strategy predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-inner-iteration-strategy.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\Sigma,\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrategyPremouse}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}strategy\\text{-}premouse} \\vdash \\mathrm{StrategyPremouse}_S(M,\\Sigma,\\theta) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(M)\\land \\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IterationStrategy}(\\Sigma,M,\\theta)","display":false}],"bytes":1349,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3499","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-strategy-premouse.md|58-df-zfc-strategy-premouse]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","1048d44b28527ff2","0134626c9734e3cd"]}